RI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"j6I_2GtM3PBLHSdl-fOgrA","review_id":"yE-XuMey0AjB_3QZyF2-BQ","date":"2018-08-24T15:40:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9437382221221924,"text_excerpt":"Wow. Can I say the chef who runs this small spot in the Catahoula hotel is HUSTLING. He cooks in a tiny space and seems to do it all by himself! Kudos,sir. The menu is small and vegan but the food is really flavorful and tasty. I had the chinese greens (these were OK and a little difficult to eat with plastic utensils...solution eat with your hands), the bao (tofu was super tasty) and the scallion pancake (the star). Everything was tasty & quick! Ordering and payment was at the bar of the hotel (Pisco Bar) so that was easy. There is some space inside the hotel/bar to eat but we enjoyed the lovely courtyard which was somehow cool enough (after an earlier rain) on a Saturday night in August..."},{"business_id":"j6I_2GtM3PBLHSdl-fOgrA","review_id":"3PBnLyGJ1bYe--Zm1Omnpw","date":"2018-10-13T18:53:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9285011291503906,"text_excerpt":"I was SO excited to finally try Midnight Noodle. There were parts I was really impressed with and parts I wasn't, but overall felt they deserved four stars as the service was great and overall food was good. Impressed with: The service - The bartender who served us was so nice and walked us through the menu. We were torn between the two udon dishes and he was super helpful in helping us decide. Smokey Bao - Pillows of perfection. Loved this dish because I'm a sucker for baos, I don't even care what's on the inside. Smashed Mala cucumber - I thought this was the bomb. It was fresh but also so flavorful. I love when people can take cucumbers and make them so tasty and complex. Definitely or..."},{"business_id":"j6I_2GtM3PBLHSdl-fOgrA","review_id":"JBEJMRE6hcNnJVhXNvH2Ug","date":"2018-11-30T03:57:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9240142703056335,"text_excerpt":"Wow so impressed by everything! If you're looking for flavor, this place definitely won't disappoint. I got the smokey bao, udon noodles, and potstickers. My favorite of the three is the super soft bao! Super cute atmosphere as well. I think the icing on top of the cake is that everything is vegan :) Will be back soon"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"j6I_2GtM3PBLHSdl-fOgrA","photo_id":"Kw8rUGmR2b5rwejrEANBaA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Kw8rUGmR2b5rwejrEANBaA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9067450761795044},{"business_id":"j6I_2GtM3PBLHSdl-fOgrA","photo_id":"blq7cpSMJWJvKcCRS02xRQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/blq7cpSMJWJvKcCRS02xRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9067450761795044}]},"notebook_case":null}
